<description>&lt;p&gt;Lebanese police arrested two Hezbollah suspects caught moving explosives near the Lebanon‑Syria border, while an Israeli drone strike wounded six people in Lebanon close to the Syrian frontier. The Israeli Defense Forces then carried out airstrikes that killed a Syrian operative accused of planning attacks on Israel from the Lebanon‑Syria border area. These actions target Hezbollah logistics and Iranian‑backed Syrian actors operating along the frontier, a shift from earlier artillery exchanges and larger bombardments. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPcXJhVUtpRTh1eGNiZjFFbzJpdnl6RlFjbHNOSDZpbXN6SVF2b241U1lnb19POTh5RHctUTlWZGItMlhXU2M5SWpPdXJpRkpUcEJWR3RoSXI3MGM0VTBsdDB5YzJhSVh6N2xNWUVoTzVYdTFfS29zaXRRSXgwQXdXSWFxRWZ3UGtfTnZzMVI0d0l6MHBpclRTbk9oeUtMOWxpN1d1cF96WDRPTWcyaEl2UDhBQTJTZ3RK?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPRmluNkF4MWxnY0lGdU1aeUhob0J5eFY0ZjNONmg1UzliYXh2MGtGaTAwZnZUQVFEWVE5Y3l4aGkwRkxpeWdjanB2RHQxUG5lR1J5OC1yaE1ES3AzZjZ6UlpFYlhyeEFaYWtMYzVITnNPeWFQWFFxTlVxa0Y2NV9DS0xVRXFkRUxmVjAtbG9VSnFTUlhKS1hxcE9HcGFndWFVNUh6cEVGbmFvZEJKTHUzUEw0UmJNVXh0VFpyOVVjZDRxU2FrQ0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/oct/10/uk-gaza-refugee-resettlement-scheme-palestinians-home-office&quot;&gt;theguardian.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
